      "resolvedDescription": "Passive: Enemies drop spell shards when casting a Summoner Spell or using an Active Item. Specific minions also drop a spell shard when Zoe or a nearby ally kills them. Zoe can pick up this shard to cast that ability once. Passive: When Zoe casts this Ability or any Summoner Spell, she gains 30/40/50/60/70% Move Speed for 2/2.25/2.5/2.75/3 seconds and tosses 3 missiles at the target she Attacked most recently. These missiles deal 15/25/35/45/55 (+10% AP) magic damage each. Active: Cast the Ability from a spell shard Zoe has picked up.",
